<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97833" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκλύζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wash over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταμοὶ οὐ συγκλύσουσί σε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Is.</u>
					43.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ca.</u>
				8.7
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be washed over by the waves</i>, of a ship, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.206d
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				467d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shake up together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κονία συγκλυζομένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					<u>Eup.</u>
					1.57
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph. in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be overwhelmed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.303
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; <i>to be plunged in debt</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.831e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be in agitation, confusion</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῆς Ἀσίας συγκεκλυς μένα πράγματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					1.18.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
